@defunx getNewOtherKey (Database* database) @arrow{} CString
Returns a new (unused) record key of the specified type.  It is the
callers responsibility to use the key or release it.  Also, the key is
in static storage and the caller should save it (strsave or similar).
@end defun

@defun releaseFamilyKey (Database* database, CString key) @arrow{} void
