@defunx releaseSourceKey (Database* database, CString key) @arrow{} void
@defunx releaseEventKey (Database* database, CString key) @arrow{} void
@defunx releaseOtherKey (Database* database, CString key) @arrow{} void
Release a key of the specified type.  It is the callers responsibility
to have already removed the corresponding record from the database.

Keys must be for a record of the appropriate type.  We accept keys
both with and without the surrounding '@@'s.
@end defun

